   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about the community",
     "texto": [
      "**Beboer** is a person who lives in a building or area. A **styre** is a board that makes decisions in a community. **Bidra** means to contribute."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reflexive and reciprocal pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "**Seg** refers to the subject: **De må snakke med hverandre** means «they have to talk to each other». **Hverandre** expresses a mutual action between two or more people."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
